==Field Bosses==
'''Field Bosses''' are boss-like enemies that may spawn in a certain set of missions, or at a certain time, or with some interval, or repeatedly under some conditions. While some Field Bosses may be required to be killed to progress the objective, oftentimes they are not the main objective of the mission. The value of rewards varies greatly between bosses.<br/>

===Obligatory===
These bosses are <u>unavoidable side objectives</u>, always required to complete the mission. They may act as secundants of the [[Grand Boss]] in an [[Assassination]] mission, or be the only boss in a different mission type in which a boss is '''not''' the ultimate goal.
